{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415738","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415738","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1041573801:1":{"text":"Ha! So you're the boom boom guy. Why? Trying to make a statement?","source_cn":"哈！搞爆炸的家伙，看你这身架势，怎么，是想造点大动静？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB17BB8C81ED969D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041573802:1":{"text":"I plan to blow everything up! That's the statement!","source_cn":"轰击！粉碎一切！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC6FC7125C3BA336","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041573803:1":{"text":"Hmm, interesting rig you've got there. Self-balancing barrel, huh?","source_cn":"有意思的小玩具，让我看看……噢，自平衡炮膛？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46C5AF6D47211504","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041573804:1":{"text":"I thought only dwarves obsessed over details like that.","source_cn":"我还以为只有矮人会琢磨这种细节。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5DD352985FC6B83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041573805:1":{"text":"Hypogean armaments are superior. Dwarf gunpowder is explosive and FLASHY!","source_cn":"恶魔军械，超越！矮人火药，花哨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB46F661B5BCC3258","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041573806:1":{"text":"Pfft. That round's got a proper bite... I'll give you that. But between shots? You've got more dead air than a forge with a dying bellows.","source_cn":"呸！讲真的，你这弹药系统，单发威力够劲儿，但射速太慢，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC761BE0EB156104","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041573807:1":{"text":"Look, my latest dwarven firepower module that triples your barrage.","source_cn":"我最新锻造的矮人火力装置，能让火药弹幕密集三倍。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x460621EC126F3694","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041573808:1":{"text":"Rat-a-tat-tat! One breath and I'll turn this roof into gravel!","source_cn":"砰砰砰！瞬间就能把这儿的房顶轰个稀巴烂！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DED746095983425","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041573809:1":{"text":"Firing rate is meaningless. One round is ENOUGH!","source_cn":"射速无用。一发，湮灭！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E0E1B23840D4FDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041573810:1":{"text":"Oh yeah? Let's make it interesting. My automated turret versus your gear.","source_cn":"哦？来打个赌，我的自走炮塔对你这身装备。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29FD09661A91506D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041573811:1":{"text":"Loser buys the next round, and apprentices under the winner for three days. Deal?","source_cn":"输家请下一轮喝的，再给赢家当三天学徒！怎么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA39DD125F8991448","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041573812:1":{"text":"I'll crush you!","source_cn":"摧毁你，胜利！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CF512F3D53FF456","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041573813:1":{"text":"Love the confidence. What's your name? I can't keep calling you \"the boom boom guy\".","source_cn":"够爽快！你叫什么名字？总不能一直喊你搞爆炸的家伙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x361EC6E258A601E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041573814:1":{"text":"Gunnar. It means \"trample\"!","source_cn":"……勒图姆，意为践踏！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB5077033BF108C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041573815:1":{"text":"Ha! Suits you. Name's Zanie.","source_cn":"这名字跟你合得来！叫我祖娅！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F4B2A463ADBF922","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041573816:1":{"text":"Before we start, cheers. I reinforced every cup in here... though I'm guessing you prefer your drink with a little gunpowder.","source_cn":"比赛之前，干一杯，我已经加固了所有的杯子，虽然我猜你更...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EC28A32A75C016A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041573817:1":{"text":"To firepower!","source_cn":"为火力！干！杯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56F09151DC649FAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"Zanie","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:勒图姆":{"text":"Gunnar","source":"勒图姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":2}}